        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/6803d0a720ca22e370f6ea7f1339a5f2.poster.avif?t=1788937184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/6803d0a720ca22e370f6ea7f1339a5f2.webm?t=1788937184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/6803d0a720ca22e370f6ea7f1339a5f2.mp4?t=1788937184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[Only available in German!]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Grenzgänger – Von der DDR in den Westen&quot; tells the story of three different protagonists who try to shape their lives in East Germany according to their own needs. They encounter all kinds of obstacles and puzzles along the way, and they need your help! Immerse yourself in Jena's punk scene, experience the city from the perspective of a young school graduate, and seek help for your sick daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run or Stay?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/b0a91475899eb5d422f0327879b1b206.poster.avif?t=1788937184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/b0a91475899eb5d422f0327879b1b206.webm?t=1788937184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/b0a91475899eb5d422f0327879b1b206.mp4?t=1788937184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art style:</strong> A vibrant game world full of dynamic, expressive, and colorful characters awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three protagonists:</strong> Assel, Hanna, and Micha offer you three different perspectives on life in the GDR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historically inspired:</strong> There are many interesting stories from the GDR, some of which served as inspiration for the game's three protagonists. Each chapter offers a unique insight into life in the GDR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress management:</strong> Even the right decision can cause stress, and this is also true for the characters in Grenzgänger. Excessive stress can influence the twists and turns in the game and should therefore be reduced through the targeted use of items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twists and turns:</strong> Not everything in life is predictable, and in Grenzgänger, too, chance determines the course of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced:</strong> The game has been completely dubbed by professional voice actors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/e8449f55eb39ec47dcde3bc9bf8380db.avif?t=1788937184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras_big/e8449f55eb39ec47dcde3bc9bf8380db.webp?t=1788937184 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/6803d0a720ca22e370f6ea7f1339a5f2.poster.avif?t=1788937184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/6803d0a720ca22e370f6ea7f1339a5f2.webm?t=1788937184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/6803d0a720ca22e370f6ea7f1339a5f2.mp4?t=1788937184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[Only available in German!]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Grenzgänger – Von der DDR in den Westen&quot; tells the story of three different protagonists who try to shape their lives in East Germany according to their own needs. They encounter all kinds of obstacles and puzzles along the way, and they need your help! Immerse yourself in Jena's punk scene, experience the city from the perspective of a young school graduate, and seek help for your sick daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run or Stay?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/b0a91475899eb5d422f0327879b1b206.poster.avif?t=1788937184\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/b0a91475899eb5d422f0327879b1b206.webm?t=1788937184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/b0a91475899eb5d422f0327879b1b206.mp4?t=1788937184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art style:</strong> A vibrant game world full of dynamic, expressive, and colorful characters awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three protagonists:</strong> Assel, Hanna, and Micha offer you three different perspectives on life in the GDR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historically inspired:</strong> There are many interesting stories from the GDR, some of which served as inspiration for the game's three protagonists. Each chapter offers a unique insight into life in the GDR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress management:</strong> Even the right decision can cause stress, and this is also true for the characters in Grenzgänger. Excessive stress can influence the twists and turns in the game and should therefore be reduced through the targeted use of items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twists and turns:</strong> Not everything in life is predictable, and in Grenzgänger, too, chance determines the course of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced:</strong> The game has been completely dubbed by professional voice actors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras/e8449f55eb39ec47dcde3bc9bf8380db.avif?t=1788937184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175790/extras_big/e8449f55eb39ec47dcde3bc9bf8380db.webp?t=1788937184 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
